-- R1 shape probe: a Decide reached from the @export closure carries a
-- parameter (a GIVEN), so it is outside yscript's propositional fragment.
-- `l4 yscript` must refuse by name rather than silently drop or inline it.

ASSUME `the amount is disclosed` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN threshold IS A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount exceeds threshold` threshold IS
    threshold > 100

@export Whether the disclosure is complete
DECIDE `the disclosure is complete` IS
    `the amount is disclosed` AND `the amount exceeds threshold` 50
